# Event messages (PR 5.1): every USERNOTICE variant and the PRIVMSG extras (bits, highlights, first
# message, channel-point rewards, shared chat), hand-written from Twitch's documented tags.
# This is also the offline showcase:
#   cargo run -p gpui-chat --release -- --replay fixtures/irc/events.irc --hud
# Two channels: #testchan (room 1000, the one to look at) and #otherchan (room 2000, there to be
# the source of shared-chat messages). ids are 44444444-0000-4000-8000-<n>; tests pick them by
# their last digits (crates/twitch/src/parse/tests.rs).
@emote-only=0;followers-only=-1;r9k=0;room-id=1000;slow=0;subs-only=0 :tmi.twitch.tv ROOMSTATE #testchan
@emote-only=0;followers-only=-1;r9k=0;room-id=2000;slow=0;subs-only=0 :tmi.twitch.tv ROOMSTATE #otherchan
